{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "15100378d4bb1c92d05b8364392036b3b0dbeda3e02a08a08d28ec3a1d938372", "ja": "#神回#本気と書いてマジ", "zh": "#这集超精采#写作认真读作拚命", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0373ac85d9cf4b2a4509920e103bd2bf189f55f2d5e1b8c801b8e36c2d737af5", "ja": "追ってきた#茜に、期待を裏切ってしまっ\nた事が悲しいと語る#ロコ。#茜は真面目に\n本心を訴え、ふたりは和解。プロデューサー\nはよかったと思いつつ、遅れ気味の#レッス\nンを頑張ろうと言う。#地獄の特訓#助けて", "zh": "#ROCO告诉追过来的#茜，辜负了\n对方的期待让她很难过，#茜则真诚地\n倾诉内心想法后两人和好如初。\n制作人感到欣慰，并要她们加紧跟上\n进度有点落后的#练习。#地狱特训#救命啊", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c13edfb692a6f39bcd4e0290e7d05d939eb7a3d06863c5fe493cf8a50c0beeff", "ja": "（茜と一緒に、ロコを追いかけて来たけど……\nここはひとまず、茜に任せてみよう）", "zh": "（虽然和茜一起追着ROCO过来……\n但这里就先交给茜处理吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "58eff8c8374950e3f48d3bccaac0c2bb80aff72b0803f819202e657691ee039c", "ja": "ロコちゃん！！　ロコちゃ～～～～んっ！！！", "zh": "小ROCO！！小ROCO～～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1003_se", "source_sha256": "5381e2a00cf3e08e60fdbd1466ad848ce8e58ee6569bb651a60381593d3364bb", "ja": "ドドドドド……！", "zh": "……（快速奔跑）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "86150bb13795b85185ef8f1833e66f8706293ccd604c540213609b74c29e05d2", "ja": "えっ、えっ？　あ、アカネ？", "zh": "咦、什么？茜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "52419cc0a42e3abdb5ab394f8bd73dbd6899e85b8c0e3b63b622061f630b0f6b", "ja": "ぜぇ、はぁ……！\nロコちゃん！　よかった、追いついて！", "zh": "呼、呼……！\n小ROCO！太好了，追上你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "fe32c6e39c749a50faf0754b8c104a5e8ae2400a87b9f563b9a7c21ef06513fb", "ja": "ど、どうしたんですか？\nそんなにフルスピードで……。", "zh": "发、发生什么事了吗？\n这么Full Speed……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "78ac4cc26fe6df7ea8a442188f446151a39857efb439e2a2c699b4ffbae46b6b", "ja": "う、うん。……ロコちゃんっ、ごめんっ！\n茜ちゃん、無神経だった！", "zh": "呃、嗯……小ROCO，对不起！\n小茜太没神经了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "cc51cad9035988645cc8373b071c69d6d7d86477b35f73aa4247c93c9237a6a8", "ja": "茜ちゃん、番組のコトしか考えてなくって。\nロコちゃんの気持ち、全然わかってなかったよ……。", "zh": "小茜脑中只想着节目，\n根本不懂小ROCO的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "205e0c4cc7c7e505edd098794c30bdc20dd595eaf21f4d356282f7e68abd3700", "ja": "そんな、謝らないでください。番組は、\nホントにグレートなアイディアでしたし……。", "zh": "别这么说，茜不用道歉啦。\n毕竟直播节目真的是很Great的Idea……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "4f5030b150e21bbd21b262c10700e61814e8d5dc3f3940f202d503ce9dca29e3", "ja": "ロコはただ、アカネのくれたオファーに\nコミットできなかったことが、情けないだけです。", "zh": "只是无法Commit茜的Offer，\n让ROCO觉得自己很没用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "e801651322df11ebb493de5e9450d707da199e4edb681737575b63c5437cfe81", "ja": "それに……。アカネのアイディアには、ロコアートが\nマストなんだって、勝手に……思っちゃって。えへへ。", "zh": "而且……是ROCO一厢情愿，\n以为Rocoart在茜的Idea里是Must的……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "d776b74edd78e0f506d337a40a984335128ada72fc26bfdc4de5a7be605e1cb3", "ja": "ロコちゃん……。", "zh": "小ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "9f7349c65b25a4e40ffa14e6ca380bdbfeb98cb2690d6e1c4c4e98b846ab41d2", "ja": "だってアカネは、ロコアートに……\nそんなに期待してなかったん……ですよね？", "zh": "因为茜其实并没有……\n对Rocoart抱太大的期望……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "92202e2640646119736200e0075850329fe554da72d4f4908190c756485b202f", "ja": "あの、えっと……そのコトだけど……。", "zh": "那个，呃……关于这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "e94a10e9ca0374fd2a05eada29beac3913adb1fe8e3be88ba2fd8be258bd5d0c", "ja": "うん！　ごめん、ロコちゃん！\n実は茜ちゃん、あんまり期待してなかった！", "zh": "嗯！对不起，小ROCO！\n其实小茜真的没有抱什么期望！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "b0ad4a23b8244e14c28fbfcee4f0efe6a65cb1025b09a78091a7313ed849a8b4", "ja": "えっ！？　……えええええ～～～っ！！？\nやっぱり、そうだったんですかぁ！？", "zh": "咦！？咦咦咦咦咦～～～！！？\n果然是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "591dddbd391201c7450db0368113ea54b30ec0e2b667454024b110cd90b56ce1", "ja": "あ、待って待って！\n違うの、そういう意味じゃないから！　誤解しないで！", "zh": "啊，等一下等一下！\n不是的，我不是那个意思！你不要误会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "efa858fe62c9d5509e30e2e2c9219b404f15846a77acf84aa58acc385e8c598d", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、ロコちゃんのこと知ってるから！　だから\nマスコットが完成しなくても、いいと思ってたの！", "zh": "因为小茜了解小ROCO！\n所以才觉得吉祥物没有完成也没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "5eec7d28e488044617ef3727695ae28b4db5c6f9970bca0242a12b2d8121f139", "ja": "え……？　どういうこと？", "zh": "咦……？什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "e35cb7f11e8d900b1eaea3dd3aa27d1be849310ef642d8db905c4877ceb137f4", "ja": "あのね、マスコットが間に合わなくても、\nロコちゃんのこと、ちゃんと紹介できると思ってたの。", "zh": "是这样的，就算吉祥物来不及完成，\n小茜认为自己也可以做好小ROCO的介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "4a509052b00bc27fcdd9f79b42a54d6e6254441d5c2cd99b1cf40c8c85952f68", "ja": "ロコちゃんは誰よりも好きなコトに夢中になれて、\n誰にも想像できないものを作る、すごい女の子だって！", "zh": "小ROCO是个很厉害的女生，对喜欢的事物\n比谁都要热衷，也会创造谁都无法想像的作品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "cda402a37f5e388916b54ada6c9dce777a9d1dd5545e0f1301ba570aba14aa1f", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、知ってるから！\nアテにしてたのは、そんなロコちゃん本人だから！", "zh": "小茜很清楚！\n因为小茜就是倚靠着这样的小ROCO本人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "533d6c78c11a513a2dea29d9ee4ce58357d4040b880fbf31b1dc603efb31a537", "ja": "アカネ……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "1a81cbc32b50ec481dbb039e98982580a5765c3966ffea4e5a1996bc723bc2da", "ja": "で、でも……。ロコは、アーティストです。\nアーティストは、オファーにコミットしないと……。", "zh": "可、可是……ROCO是Artist，\nArtist得将Offer给Commit才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "0add18e9355b09996c9c5172970009eb239667bf5b6f77141718eda18aa1a23c", "ja": "うん、そうだよね。ロコちゃんはアーティストだから、\n作品が完成してないとダメだって思ったんだよね。", "zh": "嗯，对啊，因为小ROCO是艺术家，\n所以觉得作品一定要完成才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "761f1eb01b9ceb742c4dc2a25d48defe057559c4c5ba0eb9c4b2432440a56ea7", "ja": "完成しないと、誰にもなんにも届けられないから。\nそんなの、なんにも作らないのと同じだもんね！", "zh": "不完成的话，就什么都传达不了给别人，\n那样跟什么都不做有何区别呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "6a70c19af9437cb63a743f0081c197f7a4ce6e2b743ba69b25dc03605b2123c7", "ja": "アカネ……！\nそこまでロコのコト、理解して……！", "zh": "茜……！\n居然对ROCO理解得这么透彻……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "b6c7e21a11676ac2d4b4f0e663e9586d94acb79450051af9d0e2a66239386ccf", "ja": "当たり前だよ！　茜ちゃんは、\nロコちゃんのパートナーだもん！", "zh": "那是当然了！\n因为小茜是小ROCO的搭档嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "4dd2df9db313ac0d7611df8d4dec355cbe80c464bcd16fe57deee6218273269e", "ja": "だから今回は、茜ちゃんが間違ってた！　全然\nわかってなかったよ。ホントのホントにごめんなさい！", "zh": "所以这次是小茜错了！\n小茜真是什么都不懂，真的真的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "9db0ad77463dbbe89ca0b273462346f0d53e93cef3ee455a7f7db4de084061ea", "ja": "あ、アカネ……謝らないでください！\nロコのほうこそ、ソーリーです！", "zh": "茜……你不用道歉啦！\nROCO才要说Sorry！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "ff6821ece4d51495102719a8e30c8faffb03b5ea860d78ebe51f07cad4febb93", "ja": "ロコ、ひとりでキャパシティがオーバーで……\nアカネに、相談すればよかったですね……。", "zh": "ROCO自己的Capacity已经Over了……\n应该要找茜商量才对呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_05_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "e28e3664203ceea8f41dfd124da9924bf137d21687ad65a1395fb0b89c633484", "ja": "ロコちゃん、もう1回オファーしてもいい？\n茜ちゃんとロコちゃんのマスコット、完成させよう！", "zh": "小ROCO，我可以再发一次委托吗？\n请把小茜跟小ROCO的吉祥物完成吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
